<title>MEXICO: Seguros Comercial 96 net rises 10.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Seguros Comercial 96 net rises 10.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican insurance company Seguros Comercial America said Monday it recorded a 1996 net profit of 396 million pesos, up 10.3 percent from 1995. The firm did not give the year-ago net profit figure.</p>
<p>Seguros said 1996 revenues totaled 5.262 billion pesos, up 26.2 percent over 1995. It did not give the year-ago 1995 revenue figure.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
